## Omarchy desktop

- Never edit `/usr/share/omarchy/` or `~/.local/share/omarchy/` — package-owned, overwritten on
  `omarchy update`. Customize in `~/.config/hypr/*.lua` (Hyprland) and `~/.config/omarchy/shell.json`
  (bar/notifications).
- Hyprland Lua reloads on save; validate with `hyprctl reload` then `hyprctl configerrors`. The
  omarchy shell hot-reloads (`omarchy restart shell` if needed); terminals need
  `omarchy restart terminal`.
- `omarchy commands` lists built-ins; `omarchy theme set "<Theme>"`; `omarchy refresh <app>` resets a
  config with a timestamped backup; `omarchy debug --no-sudo --print` for logs without prompts.
